OL,3,GNEWSAFive people taken to hospital
OL,4,Afollowing flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a flat fire in Kent.
OL,9,FSix fire engines were sent to the scene
OL,10,Fof the blaze in Bodycomb Street at
OL,11,FCastle Hill in Ebbsfleet at about 22:45
OL,12,FBST on Friday, Kent Fire and Rescue
OL,13,F(KFRS) said.
OL,15,FTwo people suffered serious burns, and
OL,16,Fsix were believed to have been affected
OL,17,Fby smoke inhalation, KFRS said. South
OL,18,FEast Coast Ambulance Service said five
OL,19,Fwere taken to hospitals in Dartford and
OL,20,FLondon.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
