OL,3,GNEWSAFive people taken to hospital
OL,4,Afollowing flat fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FDarford MP Jim Dickson said he was
OL,7,F"really concerned" about the fire and
OL,8,Fhas offered support to those affected.
